  "translate_en|mods/LootTracker/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_LootTracker_Options_Highlight_tooltip": "In a building you have partly searched, the containers you have not opened yet get a soft outline, so you can find the last ones. Shows only while you are inside that building (its basement too).",
