  "translate_en|mods/LootTracker/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_LootTracker_Options_Items_tooltip": "Every container you search remembers what you left in it, so the Items button on the map can find it again (for example scissors). Turning this off stops recording and turns the search off. What is already remembered is kept.",
  "translate_en|mods/LootTracker/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_LootTracker_Options_LabelMinZoom": "Show counts from zoom level",
  "translate_en|mods/LootTracker/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_LootTracker_Options_LabelMinZoom_tooltip": "How far you must zoom into the world map before the numbers show. Lower = they show when zoomed further out (busier map). Higher = only when zoomed in close. 14 is a good middle.",
