  "translate_en|mods/LootTracker/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LootTracker_CountFridges_tooltip": "When on, fridges and freezers count toward a building's searched total. Turn it off if you don't care about checking them for food. Set this before you start; changing it later can stop already-counted buildings from turning green.",
  "translate_en|mods/LootTracker/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LootTracker_MisclickSeconds": "Seconds before a container counts",
  "translate_en|mods/LootTracker/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LootTracker_MisclickSeconds_tooltip": "When you click a container to look inside, it only counts as searched if you keep it open this many seconds. A quicker look is treated as a mis-click. This only applies to clicking: taking an item out always counts straight away. 1.5 = normal, 0 = counts the moment you open it."
